{"id":"80c765fb7376d531","group":"89","path":"89/89-cor-gl-conservative.md","title":"GL Conservative Extension","display":"cor-gl-conservative — GL Conservative Extension","type":"corollary","metadata":{"type":"corollary","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-cor-gl-conservative","aliases":["89-cor-gl-conservative"],"display":"cor-gl-conservative — GL Conservative Extension","depends_on":["[[89-df-gl-logic]]","[[89-df-box-free-fragment]]","[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"corollary"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-cor-gl-conservative"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-cor-gl-conservative</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"cor-gl-conservative — GL Conservative Extension"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"0006800fa1c85177\" href=\"?note=0006800fa1c85177\" title=\"89-df-gl-logic\">89-df-gl-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"c78885ae02bfb25f\" href=\"?note=c78885ae02bfb25f\" title=\"89-df-box-free-fragment\">89-df-box-free-fragment</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"81d2de5abb2876b6\" href=\"?note=81d2de5abb2876b6\" title=\"89-df-propositional-tautology\">89-df-propositional-tautology</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the box-free fragment.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span> is the set of\npropositional tautologies of the modal language.</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}\\)</span>.</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}\n=\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}\n=\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>关键符号：</p>\n<ul>\n<li>GL是命题逻辑的保守扩张</li>\n<li>对于无模态公式，GL 的定理恰好是经典命题重言式</li>\n<li>右侧用已有 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\">\\(\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\)</span> 限制到无盒片段，避免引入没有来源\n的独立符号 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{CPC}\">\\(\\mathrm{CPC}\\)</span>。</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-gl-logic","status":"resolved","id":"0006800fa1c85177","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-gl-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-box-free-fragment","status":"resolved","id":"c78885ae02bfb25f","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-box-free-fragment]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-propositional-tautology","status":"resolved","id":"81d2de5abb2876b6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-propositional-tautology]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GL}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{cor\\text{-}gl\\text{-}conservative}\\vdash\n\\mathrm{GL}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}\n=\n\\mathcal T_{\\Box}\\cap\\mathrm{Fml}_{0}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathcal T_{\\Box}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{CPC}","display":false}],"bytes":1018,"backlinks":[],"outgoing":["0006800fa1c85177","c78885ae02bfb25f","81d2de5abb2876b6"]}